ing it to Neil and  he was like this is a little weird but  druckman ultimately came around to the  idea and nearly at the last minute Mason  said we're about three to four weeks  away from rapping and I'm like dude I am  not thrilled with this original opening  so I sent the new one to him again and  this time he was like oh  seeing the final version seeing it  edited I loved it  Mason then said that both himself and  drugman agreed that the talk show  opening was far more effective because  the information was dramatized and not  so clinical and it nearly laid the  groundwork for the rest of the series  Mason said these like quotes unquote  Monday moments with the Miller family  and this talk show intro elevated all  those scenes because now because of that  opening there's a tension that's just  like hanging in the air everything  became more tense and more captivating  because of this opening and there are no  treatments for this no preventatives no  cures they don't exist it's not even  possible to make them The Last of Us  currently has a 99 critic score and 96  audience score on Rotten Tomatoes for  the first episode as of the making of  this video so it appears they made the  right call  [Music]
 

